# Kept in sync with the .easignore at the repo root. EAS archives from the GIT
# ROOT in this monorepo, so the root file is the one that governs the upload —
# this exists so the exclusions hold whichever file the CLI resolves.
#
# Patterns are UNANCHORED on purpose: an anchored pattern is resolved relative
# to the project root and silently matches nothing.

**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/.git/

# Marketing / store-listing assets — never part of the app binary.
store-assets/
**/store-assets/

# Local Expo build artifacts and caches.
.expo/
.expo-shared/
.expo-tmp-export/
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
**/.expo-tmp-export/

# Secrets that must never be uploaded.
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*-service-account*.json
**/play-service-account.json
**/credentials.json
**/credentials/
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
